msgid "The plant entrance tank is equipped with a flow-measurement device designed to produce a linear relationship between plant flow and the water level in the entrance chamber. The standard device is the Linear Flow Orifice Meter (LFOM), which has a pattern of orifices through which flow exits the entrance tank."
